 impl Schedule {
     /// Read a five-field expression, in UTC until [`Schedule::in_zone`] says otherwise.
     ///
+    /// The grammar is the whole of `minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week`, where each field is
+    /// a comma-separated list of `*`, `N`, `N-M`, `*/S` or `N-M/S`. Surrounding whitespace and runs
