     /// The first instant this schedule names that is strictly after `after`, or `None` when it names
     /// no such instant.
     ///
+    /// One question, on purpose: "which runs did I miss" is a policy — catch up on all of them, on
+    /// the most recent one, on none and count them — and a schedule that decided would be deciding
